<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 16 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose - April 16 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 16</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............812,300 up.....8,300</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......720,200 up.....1,000</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......558,700 down...1,400</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....845,664 up ....5,110</p>
<p> Financial companies.......650,066 down...2,675</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,277 up.......933</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,013 up.......934</p>
</text>
